wTokens.colorDecorativeAmethyst400, dark: OrangeBrandColorRawTokens.colorDecorativeAmethyst300) (= light: “#A885D8FF” \/ dark: “#C5ADE6FF”)","type":"text"}],"references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"alt":null,"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleColorSemanticToken":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A semantic token that wraps a combination of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values based on the color scheme (light or dark mode)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Figma","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" inside one object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a color token has a value that depends on the color scheme, it must be packed in a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeCategoricalTagCompone